WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.802
-The president
and his Republican allies

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:05.037
have brought into
a ludicrous conspiracy theory

00:00:05.037 --> 00:00:08.808
claiming it was Ukraine that
interfered in the 2016 election.

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:10.910
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:15.114 line:0%
[ Suspenseful theme plays ]
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:15.114 --> 00:00:18.084
Among the many qualifications
you'd expect a person to have,

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:20.019
in order to become president
of the United States,

00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:22.455
one of them would be an ability
to function in the morning.

00:00:22.455 --> 00:00:24.791
That is not the case
with Donald Trump.

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:26.125
I mean, look at him.
I mean, that

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:27.994
[ Laughter ]
is how a cat reacts

00:00:27.994 --> 00:00:29.896
when you try to move them
off your bed.

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:31.230
Alright, you know, fine.
Just stay there.

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:32.899
[ Laughter ]
In fact, one small detail

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:34.934
we learned from last week's
impeachment hearings

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:36.202
was that Trump hates mornings.

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.571
You might remember
that an embassy staffer,

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:41.341
David Holmes, testified that he
overheard a call between Trump

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:44.010
and his hand-picked ambassador
to the EU, Gordon Sondland,

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.211
in which they
discussed their scheme

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:47.513
to orchestrate a quid pro quo
with Ukraine.

00:00:47.513 --> 00:00:49.081
Holmes said he could hear
Trump screaming

00:00:49.081 --> 00:00:52.051
on the other end of the call
and then added this...

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:54.154
-After the call ended,
Ambassador Sondland remarked

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:56.322
that the president was
in a bad mood,

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:58.257
as Ambassador Sondland stated
was often the case

00:00:58.257 --> 00:00:59.359
early in the morning.

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:00.827
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:02.128
First of all,
it doesn't surprise me

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:04.029
that Trump is in a bad mood
early in the morning.

00:01:04.029 --> 00:01:05.198
Look at what he eats.

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:08.033
He has the diet
of a 16-year-old stoner.

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:10.035
[ Laughter, clapping ]
When you have that much

00:01:10.035 --> 00:01:12.906
fried food sloshing around
in your digestive tract,

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:13.940
you're not gonna sleep well.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.641
That's why Trump
always looks like

00:01:15.641 --> 00:01:17.944
he just woke up screaming
in the middle of a nightmare

00:01:17.944 --> 00:01:19.979
where he's bein' chased
by a giant drumstick

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:21.881
with the head of Adam Schiff.

00:01:21.881 --> 00:01:24.884
[ Laughter and applause ]
So, the impeachment hearings

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:26.886
established not only
that Trump orchestrated

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:29.155
a criminal conspiracy
to extort a foreign country

00:01:29.155 --> 00:01:30.656
to interfere
in the 2020 election,

00:01:30.656 --> 00:01:33.059
using hundreds of millions
of dollars in taxpayer money,

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:35.928
they also established
that Trump hates mornings.

00:01:35.928 --> 00:01:38.364
And we saw Trump's irritability
on full display Friday,

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:40.800
when he woke up bright
and early and called in

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:42.869
for a video conference
with his therapist,

00:01:42.869 --> 00:01:44.604
the host of "Fox and Friends."

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:46.906
[ Laughter ]
Now, this interview lasted

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:49.908
for a total of 53 minutes!

00:01:49.908 --> 00:01:51.811
[ Audience ohhs ]
And here's a little time lapse,

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:55.014
just to give you a taste of how
long and how insane it was.

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:56.682
-Mr. Trump, good morning to ya.
-Good morning.

00:01:56.682 --> 00:01:58.084
-Good morning.

00:01:58.084 --> 00:01:59.986
-Good to have you
on "Fox and Friends" today.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:02.921
[laughs] As you said in your
tweet, another slow news week.

00:02:02.921 --> 00:02:04.190
-I see these hearings.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:06.225
Well, we have a great day
and then, you pick up

00:02:06.225 --> 00:02:09.061
the phony New York Times,
which is a total phony paper.

00:02:09.061 --> 00:02:10.563
I don't read it anymore.
You can't read it.

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:12.165
I have really good hearing

00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:15.434
and I've been watching guys,
for 40 years, make phone calls

00:02:15.434 --> 00:02:19.338
and I can't hear when you're --
and you can be two feet away.

00:02:19.338 --> 00:02:20.606
I can't hear.

00:02:20.606 --> 00:02:22.708
Why aren't all those
countries in Europe,

00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:24.210
why aren't they paying?

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.912
Why is it always
the United States, the sucker?

00:02:26.912 --> 00:02:28.781
I got elected on that.
You know, 'cause we're like

00:02:28.781 --> 00:02:30.182
a gravy train for them, okay?
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.182 --> 00:02:31.718
We're like a gravy train.

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:33.419
-Let's see if it works.
-One other thing,
before we get off.

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:35.721
[ Laughter ]
The Republican Party.

00:02:35.721 --> 00:02:37.991
Oh, yeah. I know. We can keep
this goin' all day, right?

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:39.692
It's easy.
'Cause, if you have a bulldozer

00:02:39.692 --> 00:02:42.328
-Right.
-or if you have heavy
blowtorches and things,

00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:44.296
you know, you can break through.
I love your show.

00:02:44.296 --> 00:02:45.464
-Thank you so much,
Mr. President,

00:02:45.464 --> 00:02:46.766
for being with us.
-Yeah.

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:48.233
-President Trump,
thanks so much.
-Thank you much.

00:02:48.233 --> 00:02:49.535
-Both: Thank you.
-Both: Alright.

00:02:49.535 --> 00:02:51.971
-Goodbye.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:54.741
-Well, we just went 57 minutes
without havin' a sip of water.

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:57.309
-Right. I know.
-Water?!

00:02:57.309 --> 00:02:59.078
[ Laughter and applause ]
After that, I woulda reached

00:02:59.078 --> 00:03:00.246
for the vodka.

00:03:00.246 --> 00:03:02.148
[ Laughter and applause ]
I mean, those guys

00:03:02.148 --> 00:03:03.215
barely said a word.

00:03:03.215 --> 00:03:05.017
How would Trump even know

00:03:05.017 --> 00:03:06.285
he was actually talkin'
to anyone?

00:03:06.285 --> 00:03:08.921
At some point, they should
just disconnect his phone

00:03:08.921 --> 00:03:10.757
and let him think he's on TV.

00:03:10.757 --> 00:03:11.757
[as Trump] I love your show.

00:03:11.757 --> 00:03:12.758
You people are great.

00:03:12.758 --> 00:03:14.227
What's that, Steve?

00:03:14.227 --> 00:03:16.329
[ Dial tone ]
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.329 --> 00:03:18.565
[laughs] That's a great
point, Steve.

00:03:18.565 --> 00:03:20.600
[ Laughter ]
This interview is still

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:22.201
a revealing glimpse
into the madness

00:03:22.201 --> 00:03:24.070
that has taken hold
of the Republican Party

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:26.305
and the right-wing media
apparatus that supports it.

00:03:26.305 --> 00:03:28.874
For example, when the last
impeachment hearing ended

00:03:28.874 --> 00:03:31.210
on Thursday, the Democratic
chairman, Adam Schiff,

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:34.046
ended it with a closing argument
that summarized the evidence.

00:03:34.046 --> 00:03:36.882
-This president believes
he is above the law,

00:03:36.882 --> 00:03:39.685
beyond accountability.

00:03:39.685 --> 00:03:41.754
And, in my view, there is
nothing more dangerous

00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:43.122
than an unethical president

00:03:43.122 --> 00:03:47.159
who believes they are
above the law.

00:03:47.159 --> 00:03:51.196
And I would just say,
to people watching here at home

00:03:51.196 --> 00:03:55.935
and around the world,

00:03:55.935 --> 00:03:58.103
in the words
of my great colleague,

00:03:58.103 --> 00:03:59.738
"We are better than that."

00:03:59.738 --> 00:04:01.106
[bangs gavel] Adjourned.

00:04:01.106 --> 00:04:03.843
[ Applause and cheering ]

00:04:03.843 --> 00:04:05.611
Wow. That's a...

00:04:05.611 --> 00:04:08.214
stirring defense of democracy
that neatly summarized

00:04:08.214 --> 00:04:09.682
the president's various
abuses of power.

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:11.917
And, now, Mr. President,
your rebuttal.

00:04:11.917 --> 00:04:13.519
-Adam Schiff is a sick puppy.

00:04:13.519 --> 00:04:15.287
[ Laughter ]
Let me tell ya,
he's a sick puppy.

00:04:15.287 --> 00:04:17.656
[laughing] He's so sick.
Now, Schiff, remember this --

00:04:17.656 --> 00:04:19.825
He makes it all up.
He's sick.

00:04:19.825 --> 00:04:21.060
There's somethin'
wrong with him.

00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:22.695
-There's something wrong
with him?

00:04:22.695 --> 00:04:25.698
You just spent an hour
screaming into a telephone!

00:04:25.698 --> 00:04:27.500
[ Laughter ]
You're not a president.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:31.103
You have the anger and free time
of a sports radio caller.

00:04:31.103 --> 00:04:33.072
[as Trump] I call it
the failing New York Times

00:04:33.072 --> 00:04:35.041
and let me tell you another
thing: The Mets suck!

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:36.342
[ Laughter ]

00:04:36.342 --> 00:04:39.145
I really think contrast
is worth noting

00:04:39.145 --> 00:04:41.680
and sums things up perfectly:
On one hand, you have a calm,

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:43.282
measured, fact-based
defense of democracy

00:04:43.282 --> 00:04:45.117
and the rule of law
from one side that,

00:04:45.117 --> 00:04:46.486
whatever their faults
as politicians,

00:04:46.486 --> 00:04:47.920
inhabits our actual reality.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:50.289
On the other hand, you have
a red-faced lunatic screaming

00:04:50.289 --> 00:04:52.391
at three terrified captives,
[ Laughter ]

00:04:52.391 --> 00:04:55.061
trapped on a TV set
ike they're in a "Saw" movie.

00:04:55.061 --> 00:04:56.829
I mean, look at 'em.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:56.829 --> 00:04:59.698
look like three tourists
sitting on the subway

00:04:59.698 --> 00:05:01.667
who just saw a roach
smokin' a cigarette.

00:05:01.667 --> 00:05:03.168
[ Laughter ]

00:05:03.168 --> 00:05:06.538
And, by the way, I'm sure the
roach was smokin' the cigarette

00:05:06.538 --> 00:05:08.441
because he just heard
Trump's interview.

00:05:08.441 --> 00:05:10.909
[ Laughter and applause ]
"This Trump guy's

00:05:10.909 --> 00:05:13.045
out of his goddamn mind."

00:05:13.045 --> 00:05:15.081
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:15.081 --> 00:05:17.950
[ Fresh laughter ]

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:20.953
Now, we've seen two weeks
of conclusive evidence

00:05:20.953 --> 00:05:24.156
in public impeachment hearings,
with one witness after another

00:05:24.156 --> 00:05:27.159
testifying definitively
that there was, in fact,

00:05:27.159 --> 00:05:28.427
a corrupt quid pro quo.

00:05:28.427 --> 00:05:31.197
Congress is likely
to move on to the next phase,

00:05:31.197 --> 00:05:32.631
passing articles of impeachment
in the House

00:05:32.631 --> 00:05:34.266
and starting a trial
in the Senate, so,

00:05:34.266 --> 00:05:35.701
in the "Fox and Friends"
interview,

00:05:35.701 --> 00:05:37.303
Trump gave us a preview of one

00:05:37.303 --> 00:05:39.205
of his lines of defense,
a line Republicans

00:05:39.205 --> 00:05:41.207
have unsuccessfully repeated
for weeks.

00:05:41.207 --> 00:05:44.010
Trump said he was just
concerned about corruption

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:47.279
in Ukraine, in general,
not the Bidens, specifically.

00:05:47.279 --> 00:05:49.014
-We're looking for corruption.

00:05:49.014 --> 00:05:50.516
There's tremendous
corruption.

00:05:50.516 --> 00:05:51.650
We're looking for --

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:52.885
Why should we be giving

00:05:52.885 --> 00:05:54.654
hundreds of millions of dollars

00:05:54.654 --> 00:05:57.523
to countries when there's
this kind of corruption?

00:05:57.523 --> 00:05:59.124
-Mr. President --

00:05:59.124 --> 00:06:00.192
A couple of days ago,
-Anyway, go ahead.

00:06:00.192 --> 00:06:01.894
-your ambassador
to the United --

00:06:01.894 --> 00:06:06.231
to the EU, Mr. Sondland,
in his opening statement,

00:06:06.231 --> 00:06:08.400
said that there was
quid pro quo.

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:12.037
There was quid pro quo,
he said, because you wanted

00:06:12.037 --> 00:06:14.406
an investigation
into corruption,

00:06:14.406 --> 00:06:17.443
in exchange for a visit
to the White House,

00:06:17.443 --> 00:06:18.811
or something like that.

00:06:18.811 --> 00:06:20.946
-Yeah.
Well, that's total nonsense.

00:06:20.946 --> 00:06:22.714
I do want, always, corruption.

00:06:22.714 --> 00:06:24.083
[ Laughter ]
-Ahnh.

00:06:24.083 --> 00:06:27.119
[ Clapping ]
I don't think

00:06:27.119 --> 00:06:28.453
that's what you meant.

00:06:28.453 --> 00:06:30.956
[ Laughter ]
Also, what's with
the insane syntax?

00:06:30.956 --> 00:06:33.058
[laughing]
"I do want, always, corruption"?

00:06:33.058 --> 00:06:34.827
[ Laughter ]
That sounds like something

00:06:34.827 --> 00:06:37.229
a gangster would say
in an off-brand version

00:06:37.229 --> 00:06:38.731
of "Grand Theft Auto."

00:06:38.731 --> 00:06:41.367
[ Laughter, clapping ]
"I do want, always, corruption.

00:06:41.367 --> 00:06:43.569
Car stealing
is your next mission."

00:06:43.569 --> 00:06:46.605
[ Laughter ]
It's obviously a ridiculous lie

00:06:46.605 --> 00:06:48.340
that is contradicted
by literally all

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:49.741
of the evidence.
Trump has no defense,

00:06:49.741 --> 00:06:51.110
so all he can do is
smear the witnesses

00:06:51.110 --> 00:06:52.844
with lies
and conspiracy theories.

00:06:52.844 --> 00:06:55.615
Take, for example, the former
ambassador to Ukraine,

00:06:55.615 --> 00:06:58.317
Marie Yovanovitch,
who gave her moving testimony

00:06:58.317 --> 00:07:00.052
about the smear campaign
against her.

00:07:00.052 --> 00:07:02.388
Yovanovitch is a career
foreign service officer

00:07:02.388 --> 00:07:04.557
who has served Republican
presidents and, yet,

00:07:04.557 --> 00:07:06.626
Trump concocted
a ridiculous lie about her.

00:07:06.626 --> 00:07:08.126
-I don't even know these people.

00:07:08.126 --> 00:07:10.596
You know, I come to Washington.

00:07:10.596 --> 00:07:14.066
So you've had Bush
and you have Never-Trumpers.

00:07:14.066 --> 00:07:15.968
And I come in and I end up

00:07:15.968 --> 00:07:18.504
with thousands of people
that are Never-Trumpers.

00:07:18.504 --> 00:07:20.239
-Right.
-Clinton people.

00:07:20.239 --> 00:07:21.874
And, sometimes,
the Never-Trumpers are worse

00:07:21.874 --> 00:07:23.842
than Clinton and Obama people,
believe me.

00:07:23.842 --> 00:07:26.078
But this ambassador that,
you know,

00:07:26.078 --> 00:07:27.646
everybody says is so wonderful,

00:07:27.646 --> 00:07:30.148
she wouldn't hang my picture
in the embassy, okay?

00:07:30.148 --> 00:07:31.850
She's in charge of the embassy.

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:33.152
She wouldn't hang it.

00:07:33.152 --> 00:07:35.154
It took like a year
and a half or two years

00:07:35.154 --> 00:07:36.589
for her to get the picture up.

00:07:36.589 --> 00:07:38.557
She said bad things about me,

00:07:38.557 --> 00:07:41.026
didn't wanna hang my picture
in the embassy.

00:07:41.026 --> 00:07:43.562
Standard is you put the
president of the United States'

00:07:43.562 --> 00:07:45.063
picture in an embassy.

00:07:45.063 --> 00:07:46.465
-None of that is true.

00:07:46.465 --> 00:07:49.034
The embassy in Kiev
hung the official photographs

00:07:49.034 --> 00:07:50.335
of the president,
vice president,

00:07:50.335 --> 00:07:51.570
and secretary of State

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:52.938
as soon as they arrived
from Washington, D.C.

00:07:52.938 --> 00:07:55.374
And a former embassy official
in London tweeted

00:07:55.374 --> 00:07:56.842
it took the White House
almost 15 months

00:07:56.842 --> 00:07:59.177
to get official photos sent
to embassies to hang

00:07:59.177 --> 00:08:01.180
and were instructed not
to print other photos.

00:08:01.180 --> 00:08:03.014
And I understand
why the White House

00:08:03.014 --> 00:08:04.817
would prevent embassies
from printing other photos.

00:08:04.817 --> 00:08:07.286
because, then, you could pick
whichever one you want,

00:08:07.286 --> 00:08:08.420
like this one.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:10.289
[ Laughter ]
Or, you know, like this one.

00:08:10.289 --> 00:08:12.692
Or my personal favorite,
you know, this one. I mean.

00:08:12.692 --> 00:08:14.760
[ Laughter and applause ]
In a way, that one looks

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:15.861
like an actual work of art.

00:08:15.861 --> 00:08:17.063
That should be hanging

00:08:17.063 --> 00:08:18.530
in the Salvador Dalí Museum,

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:20.198
under the title
Melting Criminal.

00:08:20.198 --> 00:08:23.502
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Awww.
-So.

00:08:23.502 --> 00:08:25.438
[ Cheering]
It was not,

00:08:25.438 --> 00:08:26.806
in any way, shape, or form,

00:08:26.806 --> 00:08:29.074
it was not Yovanovitch's
fault the pictures were delayed.

00:08:29.074 --> 00:08:30.576
It was the White House's fault.

00:08:30.576 --> 00:08:32.612
And if you're wondering why it
would take the White House

00:08:32.612 --> 00:08:35.247
15 months to send photos,
maybe it was because

00:08:35.247 --> 00:08:38.817
the guy in charge was on the
[bleep] phone for an hour!

00:08:38.817 --> 00:08:39.852
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:39.852 --> 00:08:42.688
But this is the paranoid
alternate reality

00:08:42.688 --> 00:08:44.356
Trump and his Fox News
allies live in.

00:08:44.356 --> 00:08:46.124
Anyone who disagrees
with his criminal behavior

00:08:46.124 --> 00:08:48.761
is a spy or a traitor
or a so-called Never-Trumper.

00:08:48.761 --> 00:08:49.928
Trump has used
that phrase repeatedly,

00:08:49.928 --> 00:08:51.630
even to describe
the Russia advisor

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.932
to Vice President Mike Pence
who testified last week.

00:08:53.932 --> 00:08:55.700
The advisor, Jennifer Williams,

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:58.003
was asked about that accusation
during her hearing.

00:08:58.003 --> 00:09:01.240
-Ms. Williams,
are you a Never-Trumper?

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:04.410
-I'm not sure I know an official
definition of a Never-Trumper.

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:06.245
-Yeah.
No one knows what it means

00:09:06.245 --> 00:09:07.713
because it's a dumb,
made-up term.

00:09:07.713 --> 00:09:11.450
It sounds like a fictional
animal from "A Wrinkle in Time."

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:13.652
"There were fur pigs
and gryffindoodles

00:09:13.652 --> 00:09:15.054
and Never-Trumpers."

00:09:15.054 --> 00:09:16.188
[ Laughter ]

00:09:16.188 --> 00:09:18.023
This is the paranoid
alternate universe

00:09:18.023 --> 00:09:20.158
Trump and his allies
on Fox News inhabit

00:09:20.158 --> 00:09:21.793
and reinforce
for their audience.

00:09:21.793 --> 00:09:23.663
Everyone who's against them
is a spy and a traitor.

00:09:23.663 --> 00:09:25.097
Even Gordon Sondland,
the ambassador

00:09:25.097 --> 00:09:26.899
who testified last week,
is supposedly

00:09:26.899 --> 00:09:28.567
a secret member
of the deep state now.

00:09:28.567 --> 00:09:31.470
This guy donated $1 million
to Trump's inaugural committee.

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:33.139
$1 million, and, yet,
over the weekend,

00:09:33.139 --> 00:09:36.175
Fox host Jeanine Pirro said
Sondland was out to get Trump.

00:09:36.175 --> 00:09:39.378
-His testimony is not only
canceled by the facts,

00:09:39.378 --> 00:09:41.847
but by his demeanor,
his arrogance,

00:09:41.847 --> 00:09:44.216
and his inappropriate smirking,

00:09:44.216 --> 00:09:46.218
[ Laughter ]
making it clear that he,

00:09:46.218 --> 00:09:48.554
like many
deep state bureaucrats,

00:09:48.554 --> 00:09:50.322
is not a fan of the president.

00:09:50.322 --> 00:09:52.625
-He's a deep state bureaucrat?!

00:09:52.625 --> 00:09:55.828
He's a businessman who gave the
president's inaugural committee

00:09:55.828 --> 00:09:58.264
$1 million,
and then Trump appointed him.

00:09:58.264 --> 00:10:01.934
If he's a deep state bureaucrat,
then everyone is!

00:10:01.934 --> 00:10:03.435
Jeanine Pirro probably
says the same thing

00:10:03.435 --> 00:10:05.170
about her own reflection
in the mirror.

00:10:05.170 --> 00:10:06.271
[as Pirro] Who are you?!

00:10:06.271 --> 00:10:08.674
And why are you copying
my movements?!

00:10:08.674 --> 00:10:09.975
[ Laughter ]
You're a part of the deep state!

00:10:09.975 --> 00:10:11.544
Don't point at me!

00:10:11.544 --> 00:10:13.411
[ Laughter ]
The Republican Party

00:10:13.411 --> 00:10:15.714
of Donald Trump is a movement
consumed by paranoia,

00:10:15.714 --> 00:10:18.784
peering around every corner,
looking for spies and saboteurs,

00:10:18.784 --> 00:10:22.054
indulging in disseminating
absurd conspiracy theories.

00:10:22.054 --> 00:10:23.922
For example, Trump's
been peddling an unhinged

00:10:23.922 --> 00:10:25.690
and completely debunked
conspiracy theory

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:27.760
that it was actually Ukraine,
and not Russia,

00:10:27.760 --> 00:10:29.528
that interfered
in the 2016 election.

00:10:29.528 --> 00:10:30.996
Trump repeated
that insane claim again

00:10:30.996 --> 00:10:33.298
during his interview Friday
and even "Fox and Friends,"

00:10:33.298 --> 00:10:34.767
the show that is more pro-Trump

00:10:34.767 --> 00:10:36.268
than virtually
any other show on TV,

00:10:36.268 --> 00:10:37.770
tried to gently push back.

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:38.938
-It's very interesting.

00:10:38.938 --> 00:10:40.439
They have the server, right?

00:10:40.439 --> 00:10:43.108
From the DNC,
Democratic National Committee.

00:10:43.108 --> 00:10:45.176
-Who has the server?
-The FBI went in

00:10:45.176 --> 00:10:46.511
and they told 'em,
"Get outta here!

00:10:46.511 --> 00:10:47.980
You're not getting it.
We're not giving it to you."

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:49.582
They gave the server
to Crowdstrike,

00:10:49.582 --> 00:10:52.751
or whatever it's called,
which is a country --

00:10:52.751 --> 00:10:56.388
which is a company owned
by a very wealthy Ukrainian.

00:10:56.388 --> 00:10:58.958
And I still wanna
see that server.

00:10:58.958 --> 00:11:01.059
You know, the FBI has never
gotten that server.

00:11:01.059 --> 00:11:03.495
That's a big part
of this whole thing.

00:11:03.495 --> 00:11:05.965
Why did they give it
to a Ukrainian company?

00:11:05.965 --> 00:11:08.100
-Are you sure they did that?

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:10.101
[ Laughter ]
Are you sure they gave it
to Ukraine?

00:11:10.101 --> 00:11:11.537
-Well, that's what the word is.

00:11:11.537 --> 00:11:13.238
[ Laughter ]
-Oh!

00:11:13.238 --> 00:11:14.640
Oh, is that what the word is?

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:18.043
Do ya spend a lotta time
hangin' out on street corners,

00:11:18.043 --> 00:11:19.311
gettin' the latest scoop?
[ Laughter ]

00:11:19.311 --> 00:11:22.681
Seriously, who do you
even talk to, anyway?

00:11:22.681 --> 00:11:24.950
You spent most of your time
wandering around in circles

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.485
[ Laughter ]
on the White House lawn,

00:11:26.485 --> 00:11:27.819
by yourself.
He's probably out there

00:11:27.819 --> 00:11:29.388
hopin' to find the server.

00:11:29.388 --> 00:11:30.723
[as Trump] Crowdstrike?
[ Laughter ]

00:11:30.723 --> 00:11:33.258
Where are you, Crowdstrike?

00:11:33.258 --> 00:11:35.293
It's like you know it's bad
when even "Fox and Friends"

00:11:35.293 --> 00:11:36.495
is questioning Trump.

00:11:36.495 --> 00:11:38.130
That would be like
E! putting up a disclaimer

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:39.498
during the "Kardashians,"
that said,

00:11:39.498 --> 00:11:41.233
"This is all scripted.
None of this is real."

00:11:41.233 --> 00:11:42.634
[ Laughter ]

00:11:42.634 --> 00:11:44.703
Yet, Trump's allies on Fox
and the Republican Party

00:11:44.703 --> 00:11:46.639
have actually been repeating
this nonsense, even though

00:11:46.639 --> 00:11:49.308
his own former national security
official Fiona Hill

00:11:49.308 --> 00:11:51.276
debunked it during
the impeachment testimony.

00:11:51.276 --> 00:11:52.544
And, in an interview,

00:11:52.544 --> 00:11:54.880
Trump's former Homeland Security
advisor Tom Bossert

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:56.381
also said it had been debunked

00:11:56.381 --> 00:11:58.550
and, yet, on Sunday,
GOP Senator John Kennedy

00:11:58.550 --> 00:11:59.652
repeated it, anyway.

00:11:59.652 --> 00:12:01.987
-Senator Kennedy,
who do you believe

00:12:01.987 --> 00:12:03.689
was responsible for hacking

00:12:03.689 --> 00:12:08.460
the DNC and Clinton campaign
computers, their emails?

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:12.231
Was it Russia or Ukraine?

00:12:12.231 --> 00:12:13.431
-I don't know.

00:12:13.431 --> 00:12:14.533
[ Light laughter ]
Nor do you.

00:12:14.533 --> 00:12:15.968
Nor do any of us.

00:12:15.968 --> 00:12:18.404
Miss Hill is entitled
-Well, I mean,

00:12:18.404 --> 00:12:19.471
-to her opinion.
-let me just interrupt to say,

00:12:19.471 --> 00:12:21.506
the entire
intelligence community

00:12:21.506 --> 00:12:22.874
says it was Russia.

00:12:22.874 --> 00:12:24.576
[ Scattered laughter ]

00:12:24.576 --> 00:12:27.146
-Right.
But it could also be Ukraine.

00:12:27.146 --> 00:12:28.747
-No, it can't!
[ Laughter ]

00:12:28.747 --> 00:12:31.583
Literally everyone who has
studied this said it can't.

00:12:31.583 --> 00:12:32.785
It was Russia.

00:12:32.785 --> 00:12:33.785
[as Kennedy]
Coulda been Ukraine?

00:12:33.785 --> 00:12:35.588
Coulda been Russia.

00:12:35.588 --> 00:12:37.756
Coulda been a swamp witch
that turned me

00:12:37.756 --> 00:12:39.524
into a senator, from a rooster.

00:12:39.524 --> 00:12:41.893
[ Laughter, clapping ]

00:12:41.893 --> 00:12:43.028
Could've been.

00:12:43.028 --> 00:12:44.596
[ Laughter ]
And then, there's Rudy Giuliani,

00:12:44.596 --> 00:12:46.799
who, at this very moment,
is under criminal investigation,

00:12:46.799 --> 00:12:48.466
In fact, today, we learned
that subpoenas have been issued,

00:12:48.466 --> 00:12:51.069
seeking information on
Giuliani's consulting business

00:12:51.069 --> 00:12:52.938
as part of a broad
federal investigation

00:12:52.938 --> 00:12:54.740
into possible money laundering,
obstruction of justice,

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:56.508
and campaign finance violations.

00:12:56.508 --> 00:12:58.711
Over the weekend,
Rudy was asked by Fox News

00:12:58.711 --> 00:13:00.312
if he was worried
about getting indicted

00:13:00.312 --> 00:13:02.481
and his reaction
was very Rudy-esque.

00:13:02.481 --> 00:13:05.217
-Are you afraid, Mr. Mayor,
that you could be indicted?

00:13:05.217 --> 00:13:06.585
-Ohhh, wow.

00:13:06.585 --> 00:13:09.555
[ Laughter ]
How long have you known me?

00:13:09.555 --> 00:13:10.922
-I've known you several years.

00:13:10.922 --> 00:13:12.858
-You think I'm afraid?

00:13:12.858 --> 00:13:14.893
-I-I don't know.
-Do you think I get afraid?

00:13:14.893 --> 00:13:16.728
[ Laughter ]
-Having no fear

00:13:16.728 --> 00:13:18.264
is a good quality
if you're Daredevil,

00:13:18.264 --> 00:13:21.200
but, Rudy's like a contestant
on that game show "Wipeout,"

00:13:21.200 --> 00:13:23.034
who gives a thumbs-up
to the camera

00:13:23.034 --> 00:13:25.070
right before a foam hammer
knocks him into the water.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:26.805
[ Laughter ]

00:13:26.805 --> 00:13:28.340
And I do think you get afraid.

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:29.909
I mean, have you looked
at yourself?

00:13:29.909 --> 00:13:32.044
You always look afraid.
[ Laughter ]

00:13:32.044 --> 00:13:35.013
You look like you found out
what you [laughing] did.

00:13:35.013 --> 00:13:37.416
[ Laughter ]
The Republican Party

00:13:37.416 --> 00:13:39.718
and the right-wing media
apparatus it supports

00:13:39.718 --> 00:13:42.087
are spreading insane
conspiracy theories.

00:13:42.087 --> 00:13:44.356
Meanwhile, we keep getting more
and more evidence against Trump

00:13:44.356 --> 00:13:45.824
and, every time, they go...

00:13:45.824 --> 00:13:47.626
-Ohhh, wow.

00:13:47.626 --> 00:13:49.427
[ Laughter ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:13:49.427 --> 00:13:53.098
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

